# Art Portfolio - AI Assistant Context

## Stack
- Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript (strict)
- Tailwind CSS + next-themes (dark mode)
- Apollo Client + GraphQL (Hygraph CMS)
- next-intl (i18n: en/pl)

## Environment
- **Windows + PowerShell** - Use bash-compatible commands
- **Package Manager**: npm
- **Dev**: `npm run dev` → localhost:3000

## Structure
```
src/
├── app/[locale]/         # i18n routes (en/pl)
├── components/
│   ├── pages/           # Page-level components
│   ├── reusable/        # Shared UI (buttons, inputs, etc)
│   └── sections/        # Layout (NavBar, Footer, Masonry)
├── lib/apollo-client.ts # GraphQL setup
├── types/               # TypeScript defs
├── config.ts            # i18n config
└── middleware.ts        # Locale routing
```

## Code Style
- **Components**: Functional, Server by default
- **Props**: TypeScript types (prefer `type` over `interface`)
- **Imports**: Use `@/*` alias
- **Styling**: Tailwind utilities, `dark:` prefix for dark mode
- **Data**: Server Components fetch via `getClient()` (Apollo)

## Key Patterns
- Route-based i18n with `[locale]` segment
- Translations in `messages/{locale}.json`
- Images from Hygraph CDN via `next/image`
- Google Analytics in Suspense boundary

## Environment Variables
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENDPOINT       # Hygraph GraphQL API
NEXT_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID     # Google Analytics
```

## Rules
- Test both locales (en/pl) when changing i18n
- Verify dark/light theme on style changes
- Use PowerShell-compatible commands
- Keep TypeScript strict, no implicit any
